{
  "case": "mrksic",
  "case_id": null,
  "date": "2006-04-25",
  "utterances": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE PARKER",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "I would like to welcome you all back from the break. I hope your respective Easter celebrations were satisfactory. We apologise first that because a new Judge was being sworn in we were a little delayed getting here, but our goose was saved by technical problems which delayed us even further. But I understand we're now ready to commence. Mr. Moore."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "MR. MOORE",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Your Honour, yes we are. May I just indicate to assist the Court and my learned friends that on my right sits Mr. Theunens, who is a witness to be called in due course. He is a military analyst, and with the Court's leave, and I believe there are no objections, he will be present through the calling of the military witnesses. We are in a position to call the first witness, P-014."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE PARKER",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "MR. MOORE",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Your Honour, while the witness is being located -- Your Honour, while the witness is being located, I will be asking to go into closed session or private session for some considerable periods of time because this witness, given his role, would be readily identifiable."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "JUDGE PARKER",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good afternoon, sir. Would you please take the card and read aloud the affirmation."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "THE WITNESS",
      "role": "witness",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] I solemnly declare that I will speak the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "JUDGE PARKER",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you. Please sit down."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "JUDGE PARKER",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Now, Mr. Moore, private session would be appropriate at this point, I take it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker": "MR. MOORE",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "It would, yes."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker": "MR. MOORE",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Wednesday, the 26th day of April, 2006, at 9.00 a.m. 25"
    }
  ],
